---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN u ON t.b = u.d WHERE u.d = 'x'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (b#1 == d#4)
   :- Filter (isnotnull(b#1) and (b#1 == 'x'))
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
   +- Filter (isnotnull(d#4) and (d#4 == 'x'))
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [d#4]
